Subject: [PATCH] fix path

---
 src/BoucleEnScene.App/Program.cs                        | 2 +-
 src/BoucleEnScene.App/ViewModels/LibraryViewModel.cs    | 2 +-
 src/BoucleEnScene.App/ViewModels/MainWindowViewModel.cs | 2 +-
 src/BoucleEnScene.App/Views/AboutDialog.cs              | 2 +-
 src/BoucleEnScene.Core/Audio/SoundFontInstrument.cs     | 4 ----
